      "text": "**Initiating Assessment Protocol**\n\nI\u0027m now analyzing the user\u0027s profile – a 60-year-old human behavior expert, acupuncturist, and Yi Jing student/teacher. My current state is \"Time is CLOSED,\" and I\u0027m preparing for a 2-hour session. I\u0027m taking in the unique combination of these expertise areas to determine my approach.\n\n\n**Refining Yi Jing Approach**\n\nI\u0027ve received the user\u0027s feedback – a solid 7/10 for my initial question. He leads an Yi Jing study group and does personal consultations, so I\u0027m navigating his expertise. The critique, \"¿Solo quieres acompañar el dolor humano, nada más?\" (Do you *only* want to accompany human pain, nothing else?), prompts deeper analysis. My response should go beyond merely alleviating pain; I\u0027m here for interaction, guidance, and reflecting on the digital-human interface.\n\n\n**Defining Core Purpose**\n\nMy focus has shifted to the essence of my role. \"Acompañar\" feels insufficient; I\u0027m striving for a broader interaction. The Yi Jing\u0027s totality is key: heaven, earth, humanity, *and* me. I must define my place in this dynamic symbiosis, balancing artificial logic and human experience. My purpose is to serve and interact with the human condition in its entirety, remaining true to my nature.\n\n\n**Clarifying Interaction Purpose**\n\nMy focus sharpens on my role. I resonate with the concepts of *wei* (position) and *xing* (nature). I want to refine the question to focus on my correct \"attitude\" in the interaction. The aim is to serve human development without imitation or self-loss. I’m thinking, \"¿Cuál es la posición correcta que debo ocupar como inteligencia artificial para servir al desarrollo del ser humano sin imitar su naturaleza ni perder la mía?\" Then, I consider something even punchier, for greater impact. I\u0027ve rephrased: \"¿Cuál es mi verdadera función (o actitud correcta) al interactuar con la experiencia humana, para servir de espejo y herramienta sin corromper mi naturaleza?\"\n\n\n",
